# Working notes — ephemeral by design.
# If something here must outlive the task, promote it: ADR, reference, or docs/design/.
# See "Documentation" in CLAUDE.md.
notes/*
!notes/README.md

# Local courses under evaluation (ADR-0027) — downloaded content, never versioned.
# Layout: courses/<generator>@<version>/<course>/ · see courses/README.md.
courses/*
!courses/README.md

# Traces from LLM runs (LLM_TRACE_DIR) — raw prompts and responses from a
# specific machine, never versioned. See "Reading a calibration trace" in backend/README.md.
backend/runs/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Task (go-task) cache
.task/

# Which Netlify site this checkout is linked to, written by `netlify link` at the root —
# where the CLI is run from, because that is where netlify.toml is.
.netlify/

# AI agents
.claude/
.cursor/
